Because ma’am...

00:12:30.065 --> 00:12:32.024
- Let me finish, Ms. Romero.
- Oh.

00:12:32.358 --> 00:12:34.860
Sorry. Sorry, peace.

00:12:36.612 --> 00:12:37.863
As I was saying.

00:12:38.948 --> 00:12:41.324
I did not like what
you did earlier.

00:12:41.325 --> 00:12:42.742
And if you ask me,

00:12:42.743 --> 00:12:44.954
