00:23:39.399 --> 00:23:40.525
Excuse, excuse!

00:23:40.776 --> 00:23:42.056
Hey, Aemie, where are you going?

00:23:42.527 --> 00:23:43.403
I’m heading home.

00:23:43.404 --> 00:23:44.720
