- Mhmm.

00:23:44.863 --> 00:23:46.280
- By the way, say hi to Momo for me!
- Sure!

00:23:46.281 --> 00:23:46.978
Take care!

00:23:47.003 --> 00:23:48.650
- Bye, bye Aemie! Bye.
- Bye, boys!

00:23:56.625 --> 00:23:57.751
Oh Nico.

00:23:58.752 --> 00:24:00.181
